<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Privacy Policy – SHINEX Learning Circle</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0-beta3/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/header', { user: null, showBack: true }) %>

    <main class="main-content">
        <div class="container" style="max-width: 820px;">

            <div class="card" style="padding: 36px 40px;">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px;">
                    <div style="background: #8B5CF6; width: 50px; height: 50px; border-radius: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
                        <i class="fas fa-shield-alt" style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: #fff;"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h1 style="font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 800; color: #1A0A2E;">Privacy Policy</h1>
                        <p style="color: #7a6a8f;">SHINEX Learning Circle (SLC lmt.®)</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div style="border-top: 2px solid #f0ebfb; padding-top: 20px;">

                    <div class="form-section" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
                        <h3 style="font-weight: 700; color: #1A0A2E; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                            <i class="fas fa-info-circle" style="color: #8B5CF6; margin-right: 8px;"></i>
                            1. Information We Collect
                        </h3>
                        <ul style="color: #4a3a60; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 20px; list-style-type: disc;">
                            <li><strong>Personal Information:</strong> Name, email address, date of birth, gender, and country.</li>
                            <li><strong>Learning Data:</strong> Course enrollments, progress, completed lessons, and test results.</li>
                            <li><strong>Technical Data:</strong> IP address, browser type, device information, and cookies.</li>
                            <li><strong>Interests:</strong> Topics you selected during registration to personalize your experience.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-section" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
                        <h3 style="font-weight: 700; color: #1A0A2E; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                            <i class="fas fa-database" style="color: #8B5CF6; margin-right: 8px;"></i>
                            2. How We Use Your Information
                        </h3>
                        <ul style="color: #4a3a60; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 20px; list-style-type: disc;">
                            <li>To create and manage your account.</li>
                            <li>To enroll you in courses and track your progress.</li>
                            <li>To provide personalized learning recommendations.</li>
                            <li>To communicate with you about updates, courses, and platform news.</li>
                            <li>To improve our platform and develop new features.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-section" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
                        <h3 style="font-weight: 700; color: #1A0A2E; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                            <i class="fas fa-lock" style="color: #8B5CF6; margin-right: 8px;"></i>
                            3. Data Security
                        </h3>
                        <ul style="color: #4a3a60; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 20px; list-style-type: disc;">
                            <li>Your password is encrypted using bcrypt hashing.</li>
                            <li>All data is stored securely on our servers.</li>
                            <li>We use industry-standard security measures to protect your information.</li>
                            <li>Regular security audits are performed to ensure data safety.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-section" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
                        <h3 style="font-weight: 700; color: #1A0A2E; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                            <i class="fas fa-users" style="color: #8B5CF6; margin-right: 8px;"></i>
                            4. Data Sharing
                        </h3>
                        <ul style="color: #4a3a60; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 20px; list-style-type: disc;">
                            <li>We do <strong>not</strong> sell your personal data to third parties.</li>
                            <li>Your information is shared only with administrators for course management.</li>
                            <li>We may share aggregated, anonymized data for analytics purposes.</li>
                            <li>Data may be shared if required by law enforcement.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-section" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
                        <h3 style="font-weight: 700; color: #1A0A2E; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                            <i class="fas fa-cookie-bite" style="color: #8B5CF6; margin-right: 8px;"></i>
                            5. Cookies
                        </h3>
                        <ul style="color: #4a3a60; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 20px; list-style-type: disc;">
                            <li>We use session cookies to keep you logged in.</li>
                            <li>Cookies are used to enhance your learning experience.</li>
                            <li>You can disable cookies in your browser settings.</li>
                            <li>Disabling cookies may affect platform functionality.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-section" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
                        <h3 style="font-weight: 700; color: #1A0A2E; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                            <i class="fas fa-user-edit" style="color: #8B5CF6; margin-right: 8px;"></i>
                            6. Your Rights
                        </h3>
                        <ul style="color: #4a3a60; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 20px; list-style-type: disc;">
                            <li>You have the right to access your personal data.</li>
                            <li>You can request corrections to your information.</li>
                            <li>You may request deletion of your account and data.</li>
                            <li>You can opt out of marketing communications.</li>
                            <li>You can download a copy of your data.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-section" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
                        <h3 style="font-weight: 700; color: #1A0A2E; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                            <i class="fas fa-child" style="color: #8B5CF6; margin-right: 8px;"></i>
                            7. Children's Privacy
                        </h3>
                        <ul style="color: #4a3a60; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 20px; list-style-type: disc;">
                            <li>Our platform is not intended for children under 13 years of age.</li>
                            <li>We do not knowingly collect data from children under 13.</li>
                            <li>If you believe we have collected data from a minor, please contact us.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-section" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
                        <h3 style="font-weight: 700; color: #1A0A2E; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                            <i class="fas fa-clock" style="color: #8B5CF6; margin-right: 8px;"></i>
                            8. Changes to This Policy
                        </h3>
                        <p style="color: #4a3a60; line-height: 1.7;">
                            We reserve the right to update this Privacy Policy at any time. 
                            Changes will be posted on this page with an updated date. 
                            Continued use of the platform constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-section" style="margin-bottom: 20px; background: #f8f6fc; padding: 16px 20px; border-radius: 10px;">
                        <h3 style="font-weight: 700; color: #1A0A2E; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                            <i class="fas fa-envelope" style="color: #8B5CF6; margin-right: 8px;"></i>
                            9. Contact Us
                        </h3>
                        <p style="color: #4a3a60; line-height: 1.7;">
                            For any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:<br>
                            <strong style="color: #8B5CF6;">privacy@shinex.com</strong>
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div style="border-top: 2px solid #f0ebfb; padding-top: 20px; margin-top: 10px;">
                        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px;">
                            <p style="color: #7a6a8f; font-size: 0.9rem;">
                                <i class="fas fa-calendar-alt"></i> Last updated: August 7, 2026
                            </p>
                            <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px;">
                                <a href="/register/step2" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">
                                    <i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i> Back to Registration
                                </a>
                                <a href="/" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">
                                    <i class="fas fa-home"></i> Home
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>